* DEVICE - INSPECT OR ASSIGN CP/M DEVICES

SYSOP ONLY. Private utility; use the local sysop console.

A - Purpose, syntax and examples

:A
* DEVICE - INSPECT OR ASSIGN CP/M DEVICES

SYSOP ONLY. Private utility; use the local sysop console.

Syntax:
    SYSUTLS:DEVICE
    SYSUTLS:DEVICE logical-device=physical-device [options]

Lists physical devices and their logical assignments when used without
arguments. Assignments change which devices supply console, auxiliary or
list I/O.

DEVICE CONSOLE displays console information. DEVICE CONSOLE [COLUMNS=80
LINES=24] sets console dimensions. Do not redirect the active remote
console without a recovery path.

See HELP COMMANDS for the command index.
